WEBVTT

00:12:29.633 --> 00:12:31.065
and most wonderful,

00:12:31.065 --> 00:12:33.644
and I like to think he could easily have been talking

00:12:33.644 --> 00:12:36.824
about a tapeworm that makes shrimp sociable

00:12:36.824 --> 00:12:40.073
or a wasp that takes cockroaches for walks.

00:12:40.073 --> 00:12:43.222
But perhaps, that's just a parasite talking.

00:12:43.222 --> 00:12:44.953
Thank you.

00:12:44.953 --> 00:12:48.953
(Applause)